{"id":"c7befd96bd551ade","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-consistent.md","title":"Consistent","display":"df-consistent — Consistent","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-consistent","aliases":["92-df-consistent"],"display":"df-consistent — Consistent","depends_on":["[[92-df-formal-system]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-sentence]]"],"source":"第 V 章 pp. 60–63；本地同语言系统族的定义","source_status":"原书相容性概念的本地实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-consistent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-consistent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistent — Consistent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 60–63；本地同语言系统族的定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相容性概念的本地实现"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-consistent-—-Consistent-$\\mathrm{Con}$\">df-consistent — Consistent <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\">\\(\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，规则只在本地算术公式之间推理。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> 见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal F\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span> 见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> 为本节点定义的外部谓词；固定 PA 系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 是一个实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(\\mathcal F\\vdash\\varphi\\land\\mathcal F\\vdash\\neg\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(\\mathcal F\\vdash\\varphi\\land\\mathcal F\\vdash\\neg\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本定义覆盖同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> 下的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G&#39;\">\\(G&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>。语言保持相同，公理和规则可以改变。句法正确性不要求它们一定可靠或有效。\n具有经典逻辑且能证明固定矛盾句之否定的系统，才可把该条件等价写成“不证明那个矛盾句”。任意三元组不自动满足爆炸或这种等价。\n集合论语言和抽象五元可证系统使用各自的相容性谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> 不是对象语言句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-consistent-—-Consistent-$\\mathrm{Con}$","text":"df-consistent — Consistent $\\mathrm{Con}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"